WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Thank you uncle Xie Zhuo

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,200
Where is Wen Chen?

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,200
Don't know me

4
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,600
I saw him get into your car last night

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,400
Mr. Xie forgot so quickly

6
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,200
Did Mr. Su get it wrong?

7
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,650
Speak well

8
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:13,850
What are you doing with him?

9
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:15,050
He is a child of the Su family

10
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:16,450
Of course I'll take him home

11
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:19,050
It turns out that Wen Chen is the biological daughter of the Su family

12
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:21,250
The daughter of the Su family is Su Lingyu, not Wen Chen

13
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,850
The Su family can afford to raise two daughters

14
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:24,650
Wen Chen will live a good life when he comes back and won't be wronged

15
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:26,250
Has he suffered enough grievances?

16
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:28,880
He looks down on the Su family

17
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:30,710
I won't tell you any news about him either.

18
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:32,110
Don't bother

19
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:37,980
Uncle and aunt disturbed Xiaozhuo. Open the door and don't touch your head.

20
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,580
I'm not a child anymore

21
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:42,380
Is Wen Chen a friend of Xiao Zhuo?

22
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:46,460
If you have the chance, take him to your home to play

23
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:52,550
I will stay at home for a few days this time. Xie Zhuo's vacation is canceled and he will come back tomorrow.

24
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:55,750
Why don't you talk nonsense and come back on time to receive it?

25
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:56,950
It's one day now
